WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,400
Dear neighbors

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,520
Today I took the initiative to reveal my identity

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:05,640
It doesn't mean anything else

4
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,800
I just want to ask you to help me with some supplies.

5
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,520
Our second building is poor.

6
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,640
I searched the whole building but there was nothing to eat.

7
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,080
No way

8
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,320
This is the only way

9
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:17,450
If you want to live now

10
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:20,250
Give me half of the supplies you collect from each building.

11
00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:21,730
I'll let you go back

12
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:23,680
Beautiful thought

13
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:29,820
Could it be that you think

14
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:31,140
I'm discussing with you

15
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,820
If I grab it myself

16
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:36,030
That's more than half

17
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:41,320
so many of us

18
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:42,760
No matter how good your shooting skills are

19
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:44,000
It's impossible to solve everything

20
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,560
But a few people will definitely die

21
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,300
But the problem is

22
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:48,820
who wants to die

23
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:59,780
two women each

24
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:02,290
Aren't you cold with so little clothes on?

25
00:01:03,210 --> 00:01:04,410
Is it the same as me?

26
00:01:04,690 --> 00:01:05,980
I was in plainclothes

27
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:08,060
They both have super powers

28
00:01:08,570 --> 00:01:09,690
It's mine
